### 6. Finish

Poll `get_deployment_status` only for `pending`, `building`, or `publishing`; stop on a terminal result. A successful native result with its URL verifies deployment without another status call or browser visit.

Return the literal deployed URL, saved version for save-only work, or local result. In visible tasks, open the deployed URL in the existing Site tab with `open_in_codex` or equivalent when supported; background tasks skip browser handoff. Handoff failure does not invalidate a verified deployment. Report incomplete verification or blockers; read [Troubleshooting](references/troubleshooting.md) after a failure or incomplete result.

## Design

Build around the user's primary task. Choose a coherent visual direction suited to the subject and audience, and preserve established branding when editing. Keep layouts responsive, text readable, and interactions accessible. Use imagery when it contributes to the experience.

Keep functionality within the requested scope. For open-ended presentation-led briefs, develop content and structure as needed for a complete experience. Preserve explicit content constraints and keep bounded edits bounded.

Read applicable guidance before choosing content and structure. Select by the experience's purpose, not merely its visual subject.

| Design guidance | When to use it |
| --- | --- |
| [Presentation-led sites](references/design/presentation-led.md) | New websites primarily meant to introduce, explain, persuade, or showcase: landing pages, marketing sites, portfolios, and interactive presentation sites. |

## Capabilities

Choose capabilities from the requested behavior and preserve those an existing Site uses. This is a reference index, not a checklist of features to add. Read only the relevant pages.

| Capability | When to use it |
| --- | --- |
| [Data and files](references/storage.md) | Durable records in D1 and uploads or generated files in R2. |
| [Identity and access](references/identity-and-secrets.md) | ChatGPT sign-in, user-owned data, runtime secrets, and private service access. |
| [App integrations](references/app-integrations.md) | Let the Site read data and perform actions in apps visitors have connected to ChatGPT. |
| [Site MCP server](references/site-mcp-server.md) | Expose the Site's operations as tools agents can call. |
| [Browser agent support (WebMCP)](references/browser-agent-support.md) | Optionally make the page's actions easier for browser agents to use. |
| [Scheduled updates](references/recurring-updates.md) | Update a published Site while it is closed, using an unattended data path and a linked automation. |

Hosted server code runs in Cloudflare Workers, with 128 MB per isolate and HTTP-based external connections; raw TCP is unavailable. Preserve the starter's `sites()` build integration. Capability references specify any required manifest declarations; not every feature is a `capabilities` entry.
import { useState, type FormEvent } from "react";
import { Link, useNavigate, useSearchParams } from "react-router-dom";
import { ArrowRight, Eye, EyeOff, ShieldCheck } from "lucide-react";
import { send } from "../api";
import { useAuth } from "../state";
import { ErrorBox } from "../components/UI";
import type { User } from "../types";

export default function Auth({ register = false }: { register?: boolean }) {
  const [email, setEmail] = useState(""),
    [password, setPassword] = useState(""),
    [name, setName] = useState(""),
    [visible, setVisible] = useState(false),
    [busy, setBusy] = useState(false),
    [error, setError] = useState("");
  const { setUser } = useAuth(),
    navigate = useNavigate(),
    [params] = useSearchParams();
  const rawNext = params.get("next") || "/",
    next =
      rawNext.startsWith("/") &&
      !rawNext.startsWith("//") &&
      !rawNext.includes("\\")
        ? rawNext
        : "/";
  async function submit(e: FormEvent) {
    e.preventDefault();
    setBusy(true);
    setError("");
    try {
      const user = await send<User>(
        register ? "/auth/register" : "/auth/login",
        "POST",
        { email, password, ...(register ? { display_name: name } : {}) },
      );
      setUser(user);
      navigate(next, { replace: true });
    } catch (e) {
      setError((e as Error).message);
    } finally {
      setBusy(false);
    }
  }
  return (
    <div className="auth-page">
      <div className="auth-story">
        <span className="brand-mark big">
          <span />
        </span>
        <p className="eyebrow">ВАШИ ИНТЕРЕСЫ. ВАШИ АВТОРЫ.</p>
        <h1>
          Хорошие видео
          <br />
          сближают.
        </h1>
        <p>
          Сохраняйте открытия, поддерживайте авторов
          <br />и делитесь тем, что умеете.
        </p>
        <div className="auth-orbits" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>▶</span>
          <span>↗</span>
          <span>♡</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div className="auth-card">
        <h2>{register ? "Создайте аккаунт" : "С возвращением"}</h2>
        <p>
          {register
            ? "Немного о вас — и можно начинать."
            : "Войдите, чтобы продолжить просмотр."}
        </p>
        {error && <ErrorBox message={error} />}
        <form onSubmit={submit}>
          {register && (
            <label>
              Как вас зовут
              <input
                autoComplete="name"
                required
                minLength={2}
                maxLength={60}
                value={name}
                onChange={(e) => setName(e.target.value)}
                placeholder="Ваше имя"
              />
            </label>
          )}
          <label>
            Email
            <input
              type="email"
              required
              autoComplete="email"
              maxLength={254}
              value={email}
              onChange={(e) => setEmail(e.target.value)}
              placeholder="you@example.com"
            />
          </label>
          <label>
            Пароль
            <div className="password-field">
              <input
                type={visible ? "text" : "password"}
                required
                minLength={register ? 10 : 1}
                maxLength={128}
                autoComplete={register ? "new-password" : "current-password"}
                value={password}
                onChange={(e) => setPassword(e.target.value)}
                placeholder={
                  register ? "Не менее 10 символов" : "Введите пароль"
                }
              />
              <button
                type="button"
                className="icon-button"
                aria-label={visible ? "Скрыть пароль" : "Показать пароль"}
                onClick={() => setVisible(!visible)}
              >
                {visible ? <EyeOff size={18} /> : <Eye size={18} />}
              </button>
            </div>
          </label>
          <button className="button primary full" disabled={busy}>
            {busy ? "Подождите…" : register ? "Создать аккаунт" : "Войти"}
            <ArrowRight size={18} />
          </button>
        </form>
        <p className="auth-switch">
          {register ? "Уже есть аккаунт?" : "Впервые здесь?"}{" "}
          <Link
            to={`${register ? "/login" : "/register"}?next=${encodeURIComponent(next)}`}
          >
            {register ? "Войти" : "Зарегистрироваться"}
          </Link>
        </p>
        <div className="auth-note">
          <ShieldCheck size={17} />
          <span>
            Ваши приватные видео доступны только тем, кому вы разрешили
            просмотр.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
import { useEffect, useRef, useState, type FormEvent } from "react";
import { Link, useNavigate, useParams } from "react-router-dom";
import {
  Check,
  Flag,
  Layers,
  Share2,
  ThumbsDown,
  ThumbsUp,
  Trash2,
} from "lucide-react";
import { send } from "../api";
import { useAuth, useQuery } from "../state";
import {
  Avatar,
  CopyButton,
  Empty,
  ErrorBox,
  Modal,
  Spinner,
  VideoCard,
} from "../components/UI";
import {
  number,
  plural,
  type Channel,
  type Page,
  type Playlist,
  type Video,
} from "../types";

type Comment = {
  id: string;
  text: string;
  author: string;
  created_at: string;
  can_delete: boolean;
};
export default function Watch() {
  const { id } = useParams(),
    { user } = useAuth(),
    navigate = useNavigate();
  const video = useQuery<Video>(`/videos/${id}`),
    channel = useQuery<Channel>(
      video.data ? `/channels/${video.data.channel.id}` : null,
    );
  const [commentPage, setCommentPage] = useState(1),
    [text, setText] = useState(""),
    [error, setError] = useState(""),
    [busy, setBusy] = useState(false),
    [modal, setModal] = useState(""),
    [reason, setReason] = useState(""),
    [notice, setNotice] = useState(""),
    [expanded, setExpanded] = useState(false),
    [mediaError, setMediaError] = useState(false);
  const comments = useQuery<Comment[]>(
      video.data?.status === "ready" && !video.data.hidden
        ? `/videos/${id}/comments?page=${commentPage}`
        : null,
    ),
    related = useQuery<Page<Video>>("/videos?limit=9&sort=popular");
  const player = useRef<HTMLVideoElement>(null),
    lastSaved = useRef(0);
  const lists = useQuery<Playlist[]>(
    modal === "save" && user ? `/channels/${user.channel_id}/playlists` : null,
  );
  useEffect(() => {
    setCommentPage(1);
    setError("");
    setNotice("");
    setMediaError(false);
    lastSaved.current = 0;
    window.scrollTo(0, 0);
  }, [id]);
  const login = () => {
    navigate(`/login?next=/watch/${id}`);
  };
  async function action(fn: () => Promise<void>) {
    if (!user) {
      login();
      return;
    }
    setBusy(true);
    setError("");
    try {
      await fn();
    } catch (e) {
      setError((e as Error).message);
    } finally {
      setBusy(false);
    }
  }
  async function addComment(e: FormEvent) {
    e.preventDefault();
    await action(async () => {
      await send(`/videos/${id}/comments`, "POST", { text });
      setText("");
      setCommentPage(1);
      comments.reload();
      video.setData((v) =>
        v ? { ...v, comment_count: v.comment_count + 1 } : v,
      );
    });
  }
  if (video.loading) return <Spinner />;
  if (video.error)
    return (
      <Empty title="Видео недоступно" description={video.error}>
        <Link to="/" className="button secondary">
          На главную
        </Link>
      </Empty>
    );
  const v = video.data!;
  if (v.status !== "ready" || v.hidden)
    return (
      <Empty
        title={v.hidden ? "Видео скрыто модератором" : "Видео ещё не готово"}
        description={
          v.error || "Статус обработки можно проверить в творческой студии."
        }
      >
        <Link to="/studio" className="button primary">
          Открыть студию
        </Link>
      </Empty>
    );
  return (
    <div className="watch-layout">
      <section className="watch-main">
        <div className="player">
          <video
            ref={player}
            key={id}
            controls
            playsInline
            preload="metadata"
            poster={v.thumbnail || undefined}
            src={`/api/videos/${id}/stream`}
            onError={() => setMediaError(true)}
            onLoadedMetadata={() => {
              if (
                player.current &&
                v.position > 0 &&
                v.position < player.current.duration - 2
              )
                player.current.currentTime = v.position;
            }}
            onTimeUpdate={() => {
              const p = player.current;
              if (
                !p ||
                p.paused ||
                p.currentTime < 1 ||
                Date.now() - lastSaved.current < 15000
              )
                return;
              lastSaved.current = Date.now();
              send(`/videos/${id}/view`, "POST", {
                position: p.currentTime,
              }).catch(() => {});
            }}
          />
        </div>
        {mediaError && (
          <ErrorBox
            message="Не удалось воспроизвести видео. Проверьте подключение или доступ."
            retry={() => {
              setMediaError(false);
              player.current?.load();
            }}
          />
        )}
        <h1 className="watch-title">{v.title}</h1>
        <div className="watch-toolbar">
          <div className="channel-line">
            <Link to={`/channel/${v.channel.id}`}>
              <Avatar name={v.channel.name} color={v.channel.color} />
            </Link>
            <div>
              <Link className="channel-name" to={`/channel/${v.channel.id}`}>
                {v.channel.name}
              </Link>
              <small>
                {number(channel.data?.subscribers || 0)}{" "}
                {plural(
                  channel.data?.subscribers || 0,
                  "подписчик",
                  "подписчика",
                  "подписчиков",
                )}
              </small>
            </div>
            {!v.is_owner && (
              <button
                className={`button ${channel.data?.subscribed ? "secondary" : "dark"}`}
                disabled={busy}
                onClick={() =>
                  action(async () =>
                    channel.setData(
                      await send<Channel>(
                        `/channels/${v.channel.id}/subscription`,
                        channel.data?.subscribed ? "DELETE" : "PUT",
                      ),
                    ),
                  )
                }
              >
                {channel.data?.subscribed ? (
                  <>
                    <Check size={16} />
                    Вы подписаны
                  </>
                ) : (
                  "Подписаться"
                )}
              </button>
            )}
          </div>
          <div className="video-actions">
            <div className="reaction-group">
              <button
                className={v.reaction === 1 ? "chosen" : ""}
                aria-label="Нравится"
                aria-pressed={v.reaction === 1}
                disabled={busy}
                onClick={() =>
                  action(async () =>
                    video.setData(
                      await send<Video>(`/videos/${id}/reaction`, "PUT", {
                        value: v.reaction === 1 ? 0 : 1,
                      }),
                    ),
                  )
                }
              >
                <ThumbsUp size={19} />
                {number(v.likes)}
              </button>
              <button
                className={v.reaction === -1 ? "chosen" : ""}
                aria-label="Не нравится"
                aria-pressed={v.reaction === -1}
                disabled={busy}
                onClick={() =>
                  action(async () =>
                    video.setData(
                      await send<Video>(`/videos/${id}/reaction`, "PUT", {
                        value: v.reaction === -1 ? 0 : -1,
                      }),
                    ),
                  )
                }
              >
                <ThumbsDown size={19} />
              </button>
            </div>
            <button
              className="button secondary"
              onClick={() => setModal("share")}
            >
              <Share2 size={18} />
              <span>Поделиться</span>
            </button>
            <button
              className="icon-button soft"
              aria-label="Сохранить в плейлист"
              onClick={() => (user ? setModal("save") : login())}
            >
              <Layers size={19} />
            </button>
            <button
              className="icon-button soft"
              aria-label="Пожаловаться"
              onClick={() => (user ? setModal("report") : login())}
            >
              <Flag size={18} />
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
        {error && <ErrorBox message={error} />}{" "}
        {notice && (
          <p className="success" role="status">
            <Check size={17} />
            {notice}
          </p>
        )}
        <div className="description">
          <p>
            <strong>
              {number(v.views)}{" "}
              {plural(v.views, "просмотр", "просмотра", "просмотров")}
            </strong>{" "}
            <span>{new Date(v.created_at).toLocaleDateString("ru-RU")}</span>{" "}
            <Link to={`/?category=${encodeURIComponent(v.category)}`}>
              #{v.category}
            </Link>
            {v.visibility === "private" && (
              <span className="badge">Приватное видео</span>
            )}
          </p>
          <p className={expanded ? "" : "clamp"}>
            {v.description || "Автор пока не добавил описание."}
          </p>
          {v.description.length > 180 && (
            <button
              className="text-button"
              onClick={() => setExpanded(!expanded)}
            >
              {expanded ? "Свернуть" : "Ещё"}
            </button>
          )}
        </div>
        <div className="comments-heading">
          <h2>
            {number(v.comment_count)}{" "}
            {plural(
              v.comment_count,
              "комментарий",
              "комментария",
              "комментариев",
            )}
          </h2>
          <span>Сначала новые</span>
        </div>
        <form className="comment-form" onSubmit={addComment}>
          <Avatar name={user?.display_name || "?"} />
          <div>
            <label className="sr-only" htmlFor="comment">
              Комментарий
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="comment"
              placeholder={
                user
                  ? "Поделитесь впечатлениями…"
                  : "Войдите, чтобы оставить комментарий"
              }
              maxLength={2000}
              required
              value={text}
              onChange={(e) => setText(e.target.value)}
              onFocus={() => {
                if (!user) login();
              }}
            />
            <div className="form-actions">
              <span>{text.length > 0 ? `${text.length}/2000` : ""}</span>
              <button
                className="button primary"
                disabled={busy || !text.trim()}
              >
                Отправить
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>
        {comments.loading ? (
          <Spinner />
        ) : comments.error ? (
          <ErrorBox message={comments.error} retry={comments.reload} />
        ) : (
          <div className="comments">
            {comments.data?.map((c) => (
              <article className="comment" key={c.id}>
                <Avatar name={c.author} />
                <div>
                  <p>
                    <strong>{c.author}</strong>
                    <small>
                      {new Date(c.created_at).toLocaleDateString("ru-RU")}
                    </small>
                  </p>
                  <p>{c.text}</p>
                </div>
                {c.can_delete && (
                  <button
                    className="icon-button"
                    aria-label="Удалить комментарий"
                    disabled={busy}
                    onClick={() =>
                      action(async () => {
                        await send(`/videos/${id}/comments/${c.id}`, "DELETE");
                        comments.reload();
                        video.setData((v) =>
                          v
                            ? {
                                ...v,
                                comment_count: Math.max(0, v.comment_count - 1),
                              }
                            : v,
                        );
                      })
                    }
                  >
                    <Trash2 size={16} />
                  </button>
                )}
              </article>
            ))}
            {comments.data?.length === 0 && (
              <p className="muted">
                Начните обсуждение — оставьте первый комментарий.
              </p>
            )}
          </div>
        )}
        {(commentPage > 1 || comments.data?.length === 30) && (
          <div className="pagination">
            <button
              className="button secondary"
              disabled={commentPage === 1}
              onClick={() => setCommentPage((p) => p - 1)}
            >
              Назад
            </button>
            <span>{commentPage}</span>
            <button
              className="button secondary"
              disabled={(comments.data?.length || 0) < 30}
              onClick={() => setCommentPage((p) => p + 1)}
            >
              Далее
            </button>
          </div>
        )}
      </section>
      <aside className="related">
        <h2>Ещё интересное</h2>
        {related.data?.items
          .filter((x) => x.id !== id)
          .slice(0, 8)
          .map((x) => (
            <VideoCard key={x.id} video={x} compact />
          ))}
      </aside>
      {modal === "share" && (
        <Modal title="Поделиться видео" onClose={() => setModal("")}>
          <p className="muted">
            {v.visibility === "private"
              ? "Ссылка откроется только у пользователей, которым владелец разрешил просмотр."
              : "Отправьте ссылку тем, кому это будет интересно."}
          </p>
          <input
            aria-label="Ссылка на видео"
            readOnly
            value={window.location.href}
          />
          <CopyButton value={window.location.href} />
        </Modal>
      )}
      {modal === "report" && (
        <Modal title="Пожаловаться на видео" onClose={() => setModal("")}>
          <form
            onSubmit={(e) => {
              e.preventDefault();
              action(async () => {
                await send(`/videos/${id}/reports`, "POST", { reason });
                setModal("");
                setReason("");
                setNotice("Жалоба отправлена модератору.");
              });
            }}
          >
            <p className="muted">
              Опишите нарушение. Жалобу рассмотрит модератор.
            </p>
            <label>
              Причина
              <textarea
                required
                minLength={5}
                maxLength={500}
                value={reason}
                onChange={(e) => setReason(e.target.value)}
              />
            </label>
            {error && <ErrorBox message={error} />}
            <button className="button primary" disabled={busy}>
              Отправить жалобу
            </button>
          </form>
        </Modal>
      )}
      {modal === "save" && (
        <Modal title="Сохранить в плейлист" onClose={() => setModal("")}>
          {lists.loading ? (
            <Spinner />
          ) : lists.error ? (
            <ErrorBox message={lists.error} />
          ) : lists.data?.length ? (
            <div className="list-options">
              {lists.data.map((p) => (
                <button
                  key={p.id}
                  disabled={busy}
                  onClick={() =>
                    action(async () => {
                      await send(`/playlists/${p.id}/videos/${id}`, "PUT");
                      setModal("");
                      setNotice(`Добавлено в «${p.title}»`);
                    })
                  }
                >
                  <Layers size={20} />
                  <span>
                    {p.title}
                    <small>
                      {p.visibility === "private" ? "Приватный" : "Открытый"} ·{" "}
                      {p.videos.length} видео
                    </small>
                  </span>
                </button>
              ))}
            </div>
          ) : (
            <p>У вас пока нет плейлистов.</p>
          )}
          <Link className="button secondary" to="/playlists">
            Создать плейлист
          </Link>
          {error && <ErrorBox message={error} />}
        </Modal>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
"}

tools.description:
Run JavaScript code to orchestrate/compose tool calls
- Evaluates the provided JavaScript code in a fresh V8 isolate as an async module.
- All nested tools are available on the global `tools` object, for example `await tools.exec_command(...)`. Tool names are exposed as normalized JavaScript identifiers, for example `await tools.mcp__ologs__get_profile(...)`.
- Nested tool methods take either a string or an object as their input argument.
- Nested tools return either an object or a string, based on the description.
- Runs raw JavaScript -- no Node, no file system, no network access, no console.
- Accepts raw JavaScript source text, not JSON, quoted strings, or markdown code fences.
- You may optionally start the tool input with a first-line pragma like `// @exec: {"yield_time_ms": 10000, "max_output_tokens": 1000}`.
- `yield_time_ms` asks `exec` to yield early if the script is still running. Defaults to 30000 ms.
- `max_output_tokens` sets the token budget for direct `exec` results. Defaults to 10000 tokens.
- When the JS code is fully evaluated, the isolate's lifetime ends and unawaited promises are silently discarded.

- Global helpers:
- `exit()`: Immediately ends the current script successfully (like an early return from the top level).
- `text(value: string | number | boolean | undefined | null)`: Appends a text item. Non-string values are stringified with `JSON.stringify(...)` when possible.
- `image(imageUrlOrItem: string | { image_url: string; detail?: "auto" | "low" | "high" | "original" | null } | ImageContent, detail?: "auto" | "low" | "high" | "original" | null)`: Appends an image item. `image_url` should be a base64-encoded `data:` URL. To forward an MCP tool image, pass an individual `ImageContent` block from `result.content`, for example `image(result.content[0])`. MCP image blocks may request detail with `_meta: { "codex/imageDetail": "original" }`. When provided, the second `detail` argument overrides any detail embedded in the first argument.
- `audio(audioUrlOrItem: string | { audio_url: string } | AudioContent)`: Appends an audio item. `audio_url` should be a base64-encoded `data:` URL. To forward an MCP tool audio block, pass an individual `AudioContent` block from `result.content`, for example `audio(result.content[0])`.
- `generatedImage(result: { image_url: string; output_hint?: string })`: Appends an image-generation result and its optional output hint. HTTP(S) URLs are not supported.
- `store(key: string, value: any)`: stores a serializable value under a string key for later `exec` calls in the same session.
- `load(key: string)`: returns the stored value for a string key, or `undefined` if it is missing.
- `notify(value: string | number | boolean | undefined | null)`: immediately injects an extra `custom_tool_call_output` for the current `exec` call. Values are stringified like `text(...)`.
- `setTimeout(callback: () => void, delayMs?: number)`: schedules a callback to run later and returns a timeout id. Pending timeouts do not keep `exec` alive by themselves; await an explicit promise if you need to wait for one.
- `clearTimeout(timeoutId?: number)`: cancels a timeout created by `setTimeout`.
- `ALL_TOOLS`: metadata for the enabled nested tools as `{ name, description }` entries.
- `yield_control()`: yields the accumulated output to the model immediately while the script keeps running.

Some deferred nested tools may be omitted from this description. They are still available on the global `tools` object and listed in `ALL_TOOLS`.
To find one, filter `ALL_TOOLS` by `name` and `description`.

Tool availability can change between calls.

Shared MCP Types:
```ts
type Role = "user" | "assistant";
type MetaObject = Record<string, unknown>;
type Annotations = {
  audience?: Role[];
  priority?: number;
  lastModified?: string;
};
type Icon = {
  src: string;
  mimeType?: string;
  sizes?: string[];
  theme?: "light" | "dark";
};
type TextResourceContents = {
  uri: string;
  mimeType?: string;
  _meta?: MetaObject;
  text: string;
};
type BlobResourceContents = {
  uri: string;
  mimeType?: string;
  _meta?: MetaObject;
  blob: string;
};
type TextContent = {
  type: "text";
  text: string;
  annotations?: Annotations;
  _meta?: MetaObject;
};
type ImageContent = {
  type: "image";
  data: string;
  mimeType: string;
  annotations?: Annotations;
  _meta?: MetaObject;
};
type AudioContent = {
  type: "audio";
  data: string;
  mimeType: string;
  annotations?: Annotations;
  _meta?: MetaObject;
};
type ResourceLink = {
  icons?: Icon[];
  name: string;
  title?: string;
  uri: string;
  description?: string;
  mimeType?: string;
  annotations?: Annotations;
  size?: number;
  _meta?: MetaObject;
  type: "resource_link";
};
type EmbeddedResource = {
  type: "resource";
  resource: TextResourceContents | BlobResourceContents;
  annotations?: Annotations;
  _meta?: MetaObject;
};
type ContentBlock =
  | TextContent
  | ImageContent
  | AudioContent
  | ResourceLink
  | EmbeddedResource;
type CallToolResult<TStructured = { [key: string]: unknown }> = {
  _meta?: MetaObject;
  content: ContentBlock[];
  isError?: boolean;
  structuredContent?: TStructured;
  [key: string]: unknown;
};
```

